type: software
title: Bulk RNA-seq Report
abstract: 'Offline HTML report of the bulk RNA-seq workflows: design, sample QC, PCA, per contrast volcano and MA plots, top
  genes and enriched gene sets, methods, citations gathered from every step''s provenance, and data credits.'
